  m_Name: Letter_Orchard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  letterName: Letter from the Orchard
  recipient: Dearest
  signoff: Ever yours
  textParts:
  - 'Dearest,


    The '
  - ' has finally broken over the orchard, and I found myself thinking of you at
    the '
  - ' hour. I still remember the way you '
  - ' when Father spoke about the harvest. The house feels '
  - ' without your footsteps on the stair.


    Yesterday I walked out to the '
  - ' and left a stone where we used to sit. I suppose that is a '
  - ' thing to do. Write back when you can. I will be '
  - " until then.\n\n                                                       Ever
    yours,\n                                                       "
  - 
